A||||23||AkursedX||I HATE this city!!||||8||
Z||000000||AkursedX||12-27-2001||10:15 AM||||Ok, we get hardly any snow before this week and all of a sudden the sky has to dump half the F*CKING lake on us!!!!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif">  <P>All I have been doing the past couple of days is shoveling.  I have piles that are twice as tall as my Fiero in my yard!!!  And it's still coming down.  I just shoveled a half hour ago and there is already 3 more inches on the ground!<P>I blame this on all of the people who were whining that they wanted a white x-mas.  Well they got it!!  I know I didn't want one, I hate snow with a passion.  <P>The problem is though is that this kind of snow isn't going tostop anytime soon.  It will just move to the south of me but it will keep coming.  And I knew this was going to happen.<P>See, we had a warm fall, much warmer than usual, and it kept our lake much warmer than usual.  So now that the cool dry arctic air is finally here, it sweeps over the lake, picks up all it's moisture and dumps it down on us!  And our lake-effect snow usually doesn't end until the lake freezes, which won't be for some time yet.  Geez, I feel like I'm back in my college meterology class, lol.<P>Anyways, I'm done ranting, it's time to do some more shoveling.<P>I'll try to post some pics as soon as I make it to my dad's house.<P>------------------<BR><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigpic2_2.jpg"> ||||reg||8
