Z||000004||DaRkLoRD||12-27-2001||12:06 PM||||I love snow.. I think the winters here are too warm now, we barely had snow in time for christmas. I miss the days when the snowbanks were taller than I am, and we had to keep a shovel inside to shovel away the snowbank that built up in front of our door, just to get out..<P>if I didn't like snow, then I'd probably move to a warmer climate..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>------------------<BR>    <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>    <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||12
Z||000005||Raydar||12-27-2001||12:12 PM||||I see that you're in Buffalo.<BR>I saw on the news this morning that you are prolly gonna have four feet before it's over with.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"><P>We don't get much snow in Atlanta. Just ice storms. <BR>Pulls down all the trees and power lines and just makes everything generally miserable. <P>------------------<BR>Raydar<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>From the Department of Redundancy Department.</FONT>||||reg||1
Z||000006||Screwie||12-27-2001||12:29 PM||||Well, wanna trade? I'll take all your snow, you take the weather here, it's about 6* Celcius, and it's been raining all day long, the sky is dark all day and it just SUCKS! I want winter in winter not f*cking autumn, I HATE AUTUMN IN WINTER...  <IMG SRC="http://www.stopstart.fsnet.co.uk/smilie/bult.gif"> <P>I'm pissed!  <IMG SRC="http://www.stopstart.fsnet.co.uk/smilie/cussing.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000007||AkursedX||12-27-2001||12:44 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by DaRkLoRD:<BR><B><P>if I didn't like snow, then I'd probably move to a warmer climate..   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>As soon as I'm done with college I am going to grad school somewhere other than here.<P>Screwie:  If it was just a little bit warmer, I would love that weather.  I love rain, especially storms.  My ideal day is a 60-degree rainy day. I should probably move to seattle  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  <P>This storm wasnt as bad as last year's thanksgiving debacle. That was something else.  It hit right during rush hour and people were stuck everywhere.  There was thunder and lightning while it was snowing!  It even struck the church steeple right by my house and set it on fire!  <P>Update: the snow has stopped by my house.  I only have about a foot of snow left to shovel!<P>||||reg||1
