Z||000023||Return of Fiero||12-29-2001||03:10 PM||||I'm in Nashua NH, and so far, we have 1/10 inch, and counting.. opps, now its 1/12 inches..... hmm, took too long to write this, the snows melted. DAMN, was going to take the Fiero out and screw around a bit in the parking lot. thought i could get used to my new baby. (the snow has been gone for about a week. cant say i care either way. if the snows here i play, if its not, i make money.)<P>Later Gator,<BR>Myke||||reg||1
